util/vendored/ contains five small packages copied from
github.com/argoproj/pkg (v2.0.1), Apache-2.0, Copyright the Argo Project
Authors: grpc/http, kubeclientmetrics, stats, sync, time — 11 files.

They are vendored rather than depended on so the gRPC surface in grpc-http
can be removed on our own schedule. Kubernetes client-go requires gRPC
transitively, so isolating it in one directory is the realistic first step
toward eliminating it rather than a claim that it is already gone.

